        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>极限与拉格朗日中值定理</title>\n  <script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n  <script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    html, body {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n      margin: 0;\n    }\n    body {\n      background: #ffffff;\n      color: #4f4f52;\n      font-family: \"Songti SC\", \"SimSun\", \"STSong\", serif;\n    }\n    .page {\n      width: 540px;\n      height: 720px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding-top: 166px;\n      background: #ffffff;\n    }\n    .content {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 387px;\n      padding: 49px 28px 0 55px;\n      background: #f5f7fc;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      line-height: 1;\n    }\n    p {\n      margin: 0;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .line1 {\n      margin-bottom: 25px;\n      font-size: 13px;\n    }\n    .line2 {\n      margin-bottom: 25px;\n      font-size: 13px;\n    }\n    .line3 {\n      margin-bottom: 15px;\n      font-size: 13px;\n    }\n    .note {\n      margin-bottom: 25px;\n      font-size: 13px;\n    }\n    .theorem-title {\n      margin-left: -27px;\n      margin-bottom: 16px;\n      font-size: 13px;\n    }\n    .condition {\n      margin-bottom: 17px;\n      font-size: 13px;\n    }\n    .result {\n      font-size: 13px;\n    }\n    .math-inline {\n      display: inline-block;\n      vertical-align: middle;\n    }\n    mjx-container {\n      margin: 0 !important;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"page\">\n    <section class=\"content\">\n      <p class=\"line1\">$$\\lim_{x\\to\\infty}f(x)=\\infty\\ \\text{及}\\ \\lim_{x\\to\\infty}g(x)=\\infty；$$</p>\n      <p class=\"line2\">那么 $$\\lim_{x\\to\\infty}\\frac{f(x)}{g(x)}=\\lim_{x\\to\\infty}\\frac{f'(x)}{g'(x)}=1.$$</p>\n      <p class=\"line3\">洛必达法则可处理 $$\\frac{0}{0}，\\frac{\\infty}{\\infty}，0\\cdot\\infty，1^\\infty，\\infty^0，0^0，\\infty-\\infty$$ 型。</p>\n      <p class=\"note\"><strong>备注：</strong>若条件符合，洛必达法则可连续多次使用，直到求出极限为止。</p>\n      <p class=\"theorem-title\">57、拉格朗日中值定理：</p>\n      <p class=\"condition\">若函数 $$f(x)$$ 满足如下条件： $$f(x)$$ 在闭区间 $$[a,b]$$ 上连续； $$f(x)$$ 在开区间 $$(a,b)$$ 内</p>\n      <p class=\"result\">可导，则在 $$(a,b)$$ 内至少存在一点 $$\\xi$$，使得 $$f'(\\xi)=\\frac{f(b)-f(a)}{b-a}。$$</p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
